          "html": "Once upstairs, enter the next room, <i>Open</i> the chest, then <i>Search</i> it for a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Totem_(Tribal_Totem)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">totem</a>.",
          "text": "Once upstairs, enter the next room, Open the chest, then Search it for a totem.",
